# Repo-root build context (CI runs `flyctl deploy .` from the repo root).
# Exclude everything, then descend and whitelist ONLY this app + shared libs so
# the sibling frontend app never bloats the backend build context. Each `apps/*`
# / `apps/marrow/*` line re-excludes the level below a re-included parent — this
# explicit descend is what makes nested whitelisting work under BuildKit.
*
!apps
apps/*
!apps/marrow
apps/marrow/*
!apps/marrow/backend
!libs
libs/*
!libs/**

# Re-exclude heavy / secret / non-shippable paths inside the whitelist.
**/.venv
apps/marrow/backend/tests
apps/marrow/backend/data/health.db
apps/marrow/backend/data/health.db-journal
apps/marrow/backend/data/health.db-wal
apps/marrow/backend/data/health.db-shm
apps/marrow/backend/photos
apps/marrow/backend/lab_attachments
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.env
**/.env.local
